WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Text on an ivory background: "A screenshot isn't a rent record."

00:02.800 --> 00:04.700
Tenant101 on a phone with demo data. The tenant's home shows Unit 101 with a balance of ₱81,675; an arrow marks it as still owed. Caption: Every balance, on the tenant's phone.

00:04.700 --> 00:05.833
The tenant taps Pay this rental and the payment form opens. Caption: Report the payment.

00:05.833 --> 00:07.633
Sped up four times: the amount 16,500 and the reference DEMO-0925-4471 are typed, and a receipt is attached. Caption: Amount, reference and receipt.

00:07.633 --> 00:08.733
The tenant taps Submit; the app confirms "Payment submitted".

00:08.733 --> 00:11.133
Back home, Unit 101 still shows ₱81,675. Caption: It doesn't count until it's checked.

00:11.133 --> 00:13.133
On the landlord's phone, sped up twice, the report shows ₱16,500 with its reference. Caption: The landlord checks it.

00:13.133 --> 00:14.833
The landlord approves: "Payment recorded. Receipt #152 issued."

00:14.833 --> 00:17.333
The tenant's Unit 101 balance now reads ₱65,175. Caption: Only then does the balance change.

00:17.333 --> 00:20.333
The lion mark. Tenant101. Who's paid. What's next. See how it works at tommydeleon.com. Team project, not launched, demo data.
